CREATED:20260414T020624Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260414T020624Z
UID:10077625-1776960000-1776963600@thedirt.online
SUMMARY:Celebrate Yourself Workshop (Zoom)
DESCRIPTION:Everyone comes to the earthly plane to fulfill a specific purpose and perform certain roles. Along the way\, however\, we’ve been steered in directions quite different from the path God intended for us to follow. \nCelebrate Yourself is an adventure that opens the doors for you to return to the truth of your divinity. This fun-filled workshop makes it possible for you to begin the journey back to your original purpose. \nIn this transformative experience\, you’ll:\n– Erase erroneous thought patterns and beliefs that have held you back\n– Eliminate baggage that has weighed you down\n– Shed habits that stand between you and your highest good\n– Re-discover the sacred being that you are \nJoin us for a time of joy\, healing\, and homecoming to your authentic self. \nLOCATION: On Zoom (link provided after registering) \nQUESTIONS: info@unityofdavis.org \n$25 Love Offering
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/celebrate-yourself-workshop-zoom/
LOCATION:CA
CATEGORIES:Community
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/657380612_1257101196560963_828686871244122845_n.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Unity of Davis":MAILTO:info@unityofdavis.org
END:VEVENT
